# NOTE: public/sw.js, public/workbox-*.js, and public/fallback-*.js are
# generated by next-pwa at build time. They used to be gitignored here,
# which meant Vercel's production deploy never shipped them — the PWA
# install prompt silently never fired. Do NOT re-add them to this file;
# next-pwa overwrites them on every build, so tracking them is safe and
# is what makes the install prompt work in production.
